# Build context is services/. The image is built from the Rust workspace and
# its contracts alone: everything else is left out, so a change elsewhere in
# services/ (the operator, the TMS) neither reaches the build nor counts as an
# input of the image (deploy/release/images.yaml lists exactly these).
*
!imaging
!crates
!proto
!vendor
!.cargo
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
**/target
**/fuzz/corpus
**/fuzz/artifacts
**/.env*
**/*.local
